      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atwater%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2011, the historic Atwater Hotel—listed on the National Register—was restored and repurposed to house city offices, the police department, and the library.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
