      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mary Gibbs, born just outside Atwater, is honored for saving the Mississippi River headwaters in 1903, a plaque commemorates her effort.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
